; the tables of SBR, spectral band replication, ISO/IEC 14496-3 4.A.6,
; as lib/media/sbr.inc reads them
;
; The 10 Huffman books, each the least value it stands for and its codes,
; (length code) each, in the order of the values: the envelope in time and
; in frequency, of 1.5dB, its balance, of 3dB, its balance, then the noise
; floor in time, and its balance. The offsets of the start band by the
; rate. The window of the QMF banks, 640, as the standard has it, and the
; noise, 512 of (re im), each by 2^31. Generated from the tables of the
; standard as ffmpeg has them, each book checked complete. Lists, so
; globals and not + constants.
